Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 18:32:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replaceable COUCH PARTY / LAN GAME buttons and character
 highlight

PNG files in a "textures" folder next to the game replace three menu
pictures that the game draws in code:

- couch_party_button.png / lan_game_button.png: the 64x54 picture at the
  top of the 3rd and 4th main-menu columns.
- character_highlight.png: the 64x76 frame around the portrait a player
  is on in the Couch Party character select, tinted with each player's
  colour; character_highlight_p1..p8.png give one player its own frame,
  untinted.

Any size up to 512x512 loads and is stretched to the slot, so 2x/4x
pictures work. A missing or unreadable file falls back to the built-in
drawing. docs/TEXTURES.md has the details.

